                "description": "Don-Jo  BLP-207 latch guard. This steel security door latch protector is 7 inch high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) with a rosette (levers round plate)  of 3-3/4 inch diameter or smaller. ",
